    "Condition : 1 - This consent is for a limited period of three months. This consent shall expire on 05/12/2025 and the advertisement hereby approved shall be removed and the land reinstated to its former condition by that date. \r\nReason: The advertisement is only acceptable for a limited period, having regard to the amenity of the area in accordance with  policy LP9 of the Local Plan and the requirements of paragraph 141 of the National Planning Policy Framework.",
